  "term": "giftedness",
  "definition": "Giftedness is a culturally shaped idea about being gifted, often discussed in relation to gifted people and gifted education. Research on giftedness commonly looks at how people perceive and value it, and cultural portrayals may connect it with the humanities, beauty, and generally positive emotion.",
